---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About · Nicholas Rode">
  <section class="wrap about reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Motion, product, and the handoff in between.</h1>
    <div class="body">
      <p>
        I'm an interactive motion designer with a builder's mindset. I design motion that makes
        complex products easy to understand, and I make sure it ships: production-ready, fast,
        and accessible.
      </p>
      <p>
        My background is product work: UI, interactive prototypes, onboarding flows, and the
        motion that ties them together. Today I build interactive experiences in Rive, Lottie,
        After Effects, Figma, and code.
      </p>
      <p>
        What I care about most is the handoff, the moment a design leaves my hands and has to
        survive production. So I build tools that close that gap: a published Figma plugin that
        makes strokes Lottie-ready, an AI skill that turns Figma designs into working prototypes,
        and pipelines that turn rendered animation into lightweight shaders and designs into
        React.
      </p>
      <p>Outside work: 3D, audio engineering, and hiking with my family and dog.</p>

      <h2 class="eyebrow">Experience</h2>
      <ul class="xp">
        <li><strong>Motion Designer</strong>, Webstacks <span>2025–now</span></li>
        <li><strong>Freelance Motion Designer & Illustrator</strong> <span>2024–now</span></li>
        <li>
          <strong>Junior Designer (Product UI & Motion)</strong>, Variable Medium <span>2021–2024</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-top: 48px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 56px);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    max-width: 14em;
    margin: 16px 0 32px;
  }
  .body {
    max-width: 640px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .body h2 {
    margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .xp {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .xp li {
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .xp span {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
